  "rules": [
    "Use evocative, descriptive-poetic and identity-led registers across the catalog.",
    "Every naming identity must be distinct; avoid a repeated adjective-prefix formula.",
    "Retain a source-backed product noun. Materials, finishes, ingredients and benefits require source evidence.",
    "Use The selectively for statement or identity-led names.",
    "Keep MVQueen composed and Miss.Princess playful. Do not share naming identities across the two brands.",
    "Check the live catalog before publishing; try another identity when one is already used."
  ],
